flowchart LR
    UserSystem[User or System]
    CeleryBeat[Celery Beat]
    CeleryApp[Celery Application]
    RabbitMQ[RabbitMQ Broker]
    DefaultQ[Default Queue]
    SequentialQ[Sequential Queue]
    AuditQ[Audit Trail Queue]
    CeleryWorker[Celery Worker]
    AuditWorker[Audit Trail Worker]
    TaskExec[Task Execution]
    DynamoDB[DynamoDB]
    Sentry[Sentry]

    UserSystem --> CeleryApp
    CeleryBeat --> CeleryApp
    CeleryApp --> RabbitMQ

    RabbitMQ -- routes to --> DefaultQ
    RabbitMQ -- routes to --> SequentialQ
    RabbitMQ -- routes to --> AuditQ

    DefaultQ --> CeleryWorker
    SequentialQ --> CeleryWorker
    AuditQ --> AuditWorker

    CeleryWorker --> TaskExec
    AuditWorker --> TaskExec

    TaskExec -- audit events --> DynamoDB
    TaskExec -- on failure --> Sentry